load @term/seed/space/topological
  find topological-space

# A topological manifold: a space that is locally like flat space but with only continuity assumed, no smoothness yet,
# the bare shape before calculus is added. Every smooth manifold is a topological manifold with extra structure. The
# form carries the underlying topological space; the local-Euclidean condition is the added structure.
form topological-manifold
  link space, like topological-space
